@startuml facade_general

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam classFontStyle bold
skinparam ArrowColor #444444
skinparam ClassBorderColor #444444
skinparam PackageBackgroundColor #f9f9f9

package "Client code" {
  class Client
}

package "Facade" {
  class Facade {
    + operation() : result
  }
}

package "Subsystems (hidden)" {
  class SubsystemA {
    + step1() : void
  }
  class SubsystemB {
    + step2() : void
  }
  class SubsystemC {
    + step3() : result
  }
}

Client --> Facade      : simple call
Facade --> SubsystemA  : coordinates
Facade --> SubsystemB  : coordinates
Facade --> SubsystemC  : coordinates

note right of Facade
  Provides a simple interface.
  Client is unaware of subsystems.
end note

note bottom of SubsystemA
  Subsystems can be complex
  and know nothing about
  the Facade.
end note

@enduml
